OL,3,GNEWSA'Demolition diversions cut my
OL,4,Arevenue by 80%'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner has said street
OL,7,Fclosures linked to a flyover demolition
OL,8,Fnearly forced his firm to permanently
OL,9,Fshut.
OL,11,FPhil Davies, who runs Downcast Studios
OL,12,Fnext to Park Lane roundabout in
OL,13,FGateshead, said his company had been
OL,14,Fleft as "collateral damage" following
OL,15,Fclosures linked to the demolition of
OL,16,Fthe Gateshead Flyover which suddenly
OL,17,Fshut in December 2024 due to safety
OL,18,Fconcerns.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
