OL,3,GNEWSA'Demolition diversions cut my
OL,4,Arevenue by 80%'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were offered council
OL,7,Fcompensation for disruption caused by
OL,8,Fthe structure's flattening also said
OL,9,Fthey felt the authority had let them
OL,10,Fdown.
OL,12,FThe council said it did not offer
OL,13,Fcompensation to businesses affected by
OL,14,Froadworks and the demolition had been
OL,15,Fcarried out in a "responsible fashion".
